---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="contacto" class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-24 pt-8 text-center scroll-mt-20">
  <!-- Anchor alias for #agendar backwards compatibility -->
  <div id="agendar" class="sr-only"></div>

  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[36px] border border-[#4928C2]/55 bg-[#0B0D12] px-8 py-16 sm:py-20 shadow-[0_24px_60px_rgba(4,6,7,0.9)]">
    <!-- Ambient Soft Velvet Accent -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#5B2A62]/25 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <p class="mb-4 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">
      💬 Contacto Directo · WhatsApp Activo: {SITE.phone}
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-outfit mx-auto max-w-3xl text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#F8F6FF] sm:text-5xl">
      ¿Querés consultar por tu consultorio o estudio? <span class="text-[#BF40FA]">Hablemos directamente.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/90">
      Escribime por WhatsApp para ver una muestra para tu especialidad, revisar cómo llegan hoy tus consultas o despejar cualquier duda. Respondo en el día.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-4 rounded-full border border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-500 p-2 pl-7 pr-2.5 text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-[#040607] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-emerald-400 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-emerald-300"
      >
        <span>Hablar por WhatsApp ({SITE.phone})</span>
        <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#040607] text-emerald-400 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.711 2.598 2.664-.698c.969.586 1.86.897 2.796.897h.001c3.181 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.181-2.585-5.767-5.769-5.767zm7.575 5.766c-.002 4.174-3.398 7.57-7.574 7.57-1.309 0-2.548-.344-3.649-.976l-4.383 1.15 1.17-4.272c-.722-1.15-1.107-2.483-1.108-3.864.002-4.174 3.398-7.57 7.574-7.57 4.176 0 7.572 3.397 7.572 7.57z" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-[#E3D9FC]/80">
      <span>🛡️ Garantía 14 Días</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
      <span>⚡ 1 Año Hosting $0/mes en Starter</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
      <span>🔒 Cumplimiento Ley 25.326</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
